      "text": "[12:00:00] [Server thread/INFO]: Starting minecraft server version 1.21.4\n[12:00:01] [Server thread/INFO]: UUID of player Wunga_ is 0123abcd-0000-1111-2222-333344445555\n[12:00:02] [Server thread/INFO]: Wunga_[/203.0.113.5:51234] logged in\n[12:00:03] [Server thread/INFO]: loaded from /home/bob/servers/alpha and C:\\Users\\bob\\x\n[12:00:04] [Server thread/INFO]: panel v1.api.1.2.abc.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA and -Dspawnloft.harness.token=abc123 --accessToken xyz token:sess:u\n[12:00:05] [Server thread/WARN]: **** FAILED TO BIND TO PORT!\njava.net.BindException: Address already in use\n\tat sun.nio.ch.Net.bind(Native Method)\n[12:00:06] [Server thread/INFO]: chained v1.api.1.2.a.v1.api.3.4.b.AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA end\n[12:00:07] [Server thread/INFO]: Stopping server\n",
